     "\n\n\n\n<div>\n<font face=\"Calibri, Verdana, Helvetica, Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Dear All<br>\n<br>\nWe currently have one Bioinformatics Opening at Barts Cancer Institute to contribute to the development of our cancer bioinformatics platform and analytical tools. <br>\n<br>\n</span></font><font size=\"1\"><font face=\"Arial Bold\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\">Postdoctoral Research Assistant - Bioinformatician</span></font></font><font face=\"Calibri, Verdana, Helvetica, Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">  <a href=\"http://webapps.qmul.ac.uk/hr/vacancies/jobs.php?id=2275\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://webapps.qmul.ac.uk/hr/vacancies/jobs.php?id%3D2275&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231239519000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZcgpQFv5o3Ksy_30AmChX\">http://webapps.qmul.ac.uk/hr/vacancies/jobs.php?id=2275</a> closing date </span></font><font size=\"1\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt\">15-04-2011<br>\n</span></font></font><font face=\"Calibri, Verdana, Helvetica, Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><br>\nPlease could you bring these posts to the attention of ambitious people who may be interested in coming to London and joining our Centre. <br>\n<br>\nMany thanks.<br>\n<br>\nClaude Chelala<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>\nDr Claude Chelala<br>\nLecturer in Bioinformatics<br>\nBarts Cancer Institute - a CR-UK Centre of Excellence<br>\nQueen Mary University of London<br>\nJohn Vane Science Centre<br>\nCharterhouse Square<br>\nLONDON<br>\nEC1M 6BQ<br>\nTel: <a href=\"tel:+44%2020%207882%203570\" value=\"+442078823570\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)20 7882 3570</a><br>\nFax: <a href=\"tel:+44%2020%207882%203884\" value=\"+442078823884\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)20 7882 3884</a><br>\nemail: <a href=\"http://c.c...@qmul.ac.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\